<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina sees NYSE listing September 3.</title>
<headline>PetroFina sees NYSE listing September 3.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil and gas group PetroFina said on Thursday it expected to be listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) on September 3.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it was actively working with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) and NYSE on the introduction.</p>
<p>&quot;The first listing is expected on Wednesday, September 3,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
